  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE31.2 / CRE32.4",
      "summary": "Sovereign exposures are exempt from the 0.05% PD floor, yet the risk-weight function uses ln(PD) and G(PD), which are undefined at PD = 0.",
      "impact": "Position: Sovereign exposure, PD estimate 0%, LGD 45%, EAD 100, M = 2.5. Reading a: Literal formula: ln(0) and G(0) undefined, RWA not defined. Reading b: Implicit positive PD: RWA defined. Difference: RWA undefined vs finite (not executed)",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
